{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_02",
  "title": "Asymmetrical Garden",
  "storyCode": "CR-2",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b09e25f2a6fea5e8147c7ef9471bcfdb97bb878ddbb84f16f76d7cbd1644f1ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, my friend is coming. She'll take care of the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I came as soon as I heard. What happened? Let me take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, don't grab my head. And don't lift my skirt with so many people watching."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, you look alive enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks to these two. They helped me when I had a flare-up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just doing what any doctor should."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There aren't many doctors like you left. Most can't run away fast enough when they find out about our condition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you're here to take care of her, then we'll be leaving."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait! Here's my card. Please feel free to visit my massage parlor any time. 20% off for you amigos!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you, but I don't think we'll need—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's good, you know. Whenever we get an ache or pain, all of us go right to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm a physician, I know how to take care of myself. I don't need any help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just try it, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please, keep your distance, ma'am."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The woman takes a few steps back, puts on a pair of gloves, then snaps her fingers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure. I can do it from this distance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can touch me from there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ahem... I've heard of people claiming the ability to perform therapy from afar. Whether it's called 'Qi' or some other name, most research indicates that it's pseudoscie—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the woman's fingers move through the air, the pair feel a warm sensation on their shoulders, and soon feel a sense of comfort that envelopes them gently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh... my stress and anxiety... all gone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Am I imagining it? I feel so good... oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well... I guess I can forget the research..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What? Someone stole the meds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is no joke, Ernesto. We have a lot of Infected in the community who need those meds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We apologize for failing to deliver. We'll try to make up for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't really think money will do it, do you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we can't find the meds, I'll try to obtain an equivalent amount of medicine in a timely manner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, Señor Ernesto. I'm just nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you see the robbers? We have plenty of eyes and ears here. Maybe we can help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's what felt strange. It looked like a prepared ambush. Rhodes Island has always treaded carefully around here, trying not to make enemies..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't imagine why anyone would target us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe they had their eyes on your meds. Suppressants fetch a good price on the black market."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They were very professional. Quick and efficient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are our meds really worth that kind of effort? And also, I think I heard the sound of gunfire while we were running."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guns... pros, again. I'm glad Reynell thinks so highly of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You think someone is targeting your community?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our grudge with Reynell goes back a long way. But I never thought he would do something so dirty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's with the commotion downstairs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like someone's condition flared up while they were outside and got help from kind passersby. People are gathering to thank them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We always repay acts of kindness. Let me see their faces..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say, haven't I seen them before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man picks up yesterday's newspaper and flips to the gossip section, pausing at its title: 'No one can stand him! Reynell changes bodyguards AGAIN.'\nSubtitle: 'Exclusive report: Four guards, two shifts? Who are they?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey... they look really like the ones down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like we really have to 'repay' their 'kindness.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I feel like I've been born again... It's hard to describe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you... It's such an astonishing massage technique."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I learned it in Kjerag. I had to climb Mt. Karlan in a snowstorm to convince the Saintess there to teach me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pah, you came here from Siracusa what, seven or eight years ago? When did you have the time to go to the Snow Realm? Don't believe her tall tales."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, I resent the accusation!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, thank you for the massage. But we should go—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Reynell has a lot of people working for him. A couple less won't make any difference."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about you stay a little while longer and enjoy our hospitality?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Er..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Papá? What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why are you with these medicine robbers? Why did you bring them here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Medicine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, medicine for Oripathy! They stole it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stole? It couldn't be them! They don't even know what Oripathy is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We don't know anything about any medicine. Could there be a misunderstanding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Misunderstanding? Who else but Blacksteel and you dress like mercenaries and use guns in these parts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We were just bringing the girl back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, if there's a misunderstanding, we'll clear it up. Take them in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The duo see Diaz's aide raise his staff.\nWhile they cannot imagine how the light at the tip of the staff would do damage, they instinctively sense the approaching danger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Run, Kateb!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come on, you gun-toting thugs! I dare you to set foot in this neighborhood!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were too fast, I couldn't catch you. Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hiding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you doing standing there? Find them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diaz's Aide",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Move, move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What was that? Magic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think they called it Originium Arts. But I guess magic is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to find a way out. The exits are all guarded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cover me. I'll control the replicate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gemini Replicator active."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confused Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, where did they go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lazy Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not here, not there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confused Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where did she come from?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Confused Community Resident",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right in the middle of the road!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bows, crossbows, launchers, Arts Units... all sorts of weapons point towards the gemini decoy in the middle of the road.\nEven Iana is speechless at the reception."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well... talk about a warm welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bows, crossbows, bombs, 'magic'... hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's go while they're distracted by the decoy. It won't take long for them to figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe we should get in touch with Ela, see what's going on. I'm just so confused right now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, I'm sure it's not Reynell's guys. His guards have been busy getting whipped by Shuhrat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure he's telling the truth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sure. He hasn't had a chance to give an order like that today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the people here seem sure that we stole their medicine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not important. What's important is that we get out of that neighborhood ASAP..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's dangerous for you two to continue, given their special powers. Do you need support?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. Their Originium Arts are impressive, but they're just a disorganized mob. I know how to protect myself, and Kateb's here with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Get in touch if anything happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They've dispersed, Meijer. Time to move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, I've taken a look from up high. The district is roughly divided into three areas: the outer ring, the residential district, and that building at the center."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which is always patrolled by guys with magic wands. There must be someone or something important there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not important. We're steering well clear of it anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about going through the residential area? I didn't see anyone armed. It seems to be a safe path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or it could be more dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "True... common sense doesn't apply to this planet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wah—Wah—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't cry, babe, daddy will sing you a song."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where are you flying, tired fowlbeast♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Towards tomorrow's wind♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't you know♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your wings are for today♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Whisper) Asleep, finally..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I didn't think I would hear a song like that here.\nYikes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something just dashed past my feet. Rat, snail... I'm not sure. It's too dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is their garbage dump. No wonder no one comes here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The way out is just ahead. You should be glad that people don't come to this stink heap."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hostiles?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, just light from that window."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why would they do this in their own home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Left",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, thank you so much, honey. That fowlbeast just kept running."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Left",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it's not running anymore. Now we can—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Left",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh no, it's waking up again! Arts like that just don't work here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Left",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Loud fowlbeast crowing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh no, she's waking up again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sound from Window on the Right",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Loud baby crying)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ha..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I guess Originium Arts isn't the answer to everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at the colored acrylic boards on the walls. Only people who think of this place as home would put up decorations with no practical use like those."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Same goes for the graffiti on this side. The scenes, figures and decorations don't look like casual doodles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Every picture seems to tell a story."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh-What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Er, girl, we..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Calm down. We didn't do what that gentleman accused us of... It's a misunderstanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I don't know. You helped me, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We mean no harm... You know that, girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
